<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the US$7.6 million Australian Open tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Women's singles, quarter-finals</p>
<p>14-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) beat Dominique van Roost (Belgium) 7-5 4-0 (retired)  </p>
<p>4-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat 8-Irina Spirlea (Romania) 7-5 6-2</p>
<p>Men's singles, quarter-finals</p>
<p>5-Thomas Muster (Austria) beat 3-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) 6-4 6-2 6-3</p>
</text>
